		<ol importance="required" outputclass="callout" id="e01222">
			<li>
				<p importance="optional">Front center side air bag</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<p importance="default">The actual air bags in the vehicle may differ from the illustration.</p>
		<note type="note" id="e01223">
			<p>Refer to the WARNING, CAUTION and NOTE of ‘Air bag Precautions.’</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
